  "Give each Best of N fork its own clone of your Git repository instead of a copy-on-write overlay. Each fork is then a real repository, so commits it makes are kept when you choose it as the winner. Forks take longer to create, and the wait grows with the size of your repository. See go/jetski-best-of-n.": "为每个 Best of N 分支创建独立的 Git 仓库克隆而非写时复制。分支即为真实仓库，采纳时其提交将被保留。创建耗时随仓库大小递增。",
